    <!-- ===== About dialog ===== -->
    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_content">FT8 Plus for Android

Version: 1.0.261026
Author: BI3BJU

Features:
- Real-time FT8 decoding (requires microphone permission)
- Custom transparent text transmission (max 574 bytes, auto-framed)
- Multi-frame continuous transmission (i3=6, f2=1)
- Automatic 15-second slot decoding
- Contact management
- Callsign format: 3-7 chars, 1-2 prefix + digit + 0-4 letters, prefix must contain a letter
- Auto-save source callsign to contacts on any RX message
- Underline display when your own callsign is received
- Max 100 contacts, remark up to 32 bytes
- Preamble noise: play white noise + silence 1s before each frame
- Real-time Sending... status in history
- Beacon: every 16 slots (240s) transmits a location beacon (CALL + 8-char Maidenhead grid, encoded as 13 Base42 chars)
- NTP time sync (cn.pool.ntp.org / pool.ntp.org), does not modify system time
- History/status logs persisted (latest 100 lines)

Fixed parameters:
- Period 15 s; sample rate 12000 Hz; symbol rate 6.25; HPS=4; BPT=2.
- 0.04 s per hop; 0.160 s per symbol; 375 hops per period; 750 hops for two periods.
- TX frequency 300-3000 Hz; default 1500 Hz; step 6.25 Hz.
- Max raw data 574 bytes; max 64 frames; frequency grouping tolerance +/-10 Hz; merge delay 4 slots (60 s).

Persistent files:
- config.txt: callsign, TX frequency, preamble noise.
- contact.txt: contacts, one line per contact as callsign,note.
- history.txt: history, JSON Lines.
- status.txt: status log, plain text.

Note: For amateur radio FT8 experimentation only.</string>

